      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how terrifying it is to feel like you're losing your mind and becoming nothing more than a hollow shell. It is completely understandable that you are terrified of this future, but you are right to see that your husband is already starting to notice the change. Please know that this feeling of being empty is a symptom of the illness, not a sign that your life is over, and there are treatments that can help restore your thoughts and memories. You deserve to feel whole again, and with the right medical help, the fog can lift and you can reclaim the person you are.",
