    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not talking about a mental illness. i'm talking about reality. it's not a \"symptom\" to realize that my brain is physically failing. it's just the truth. it's not about being \"desperate,\" it's about wanting to have some say in how my story ends. instead of just waiting for the lights to go out one by one, why is it so wrong to want to end it on my own terms while i still have the capacity to decide?",
